eded. Because she didn't have many opportunities to attend school regularly, she has developed an introverted personality and has become a loner. She used to practice Para Para dance for a long time, but with the worsening of her illness, she has not been able to engage in any intense physical activity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After losing her family in the 1998 flood, she decided to accept Kou Shamo's suggestion and come to Japan, although she barely spoke Japanese."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c155625"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/368280a46a8dd9eb17ad9fa07bb74bb70723bceacbab518a2a2d89b2bebf8059.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8ba591da1ea6c2a6e148ab8067e988badc03f466213df6abc2877b7eb4f96c51.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"蔡 书瑾","creatorId":"vndb:s25325","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s25325","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s25325","name":"蔡 书瑾","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:99475","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c159272","characterName":"櫻井 栞奈","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c159272"},"originalCharacterName":"櫻井 栞奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"27"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Born in the summer of 1972, currently 27 years old (as of 1999)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c159272"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/658640a3406511b1eeab2b75dcb4a235cbf2c2ea6b99a954dd5748a42bb8cb1a.webp","fallbackUr